---
<section class="competencies-section">
  <div class="competencies-container">
    <h2>Kernkompetenzen & Domänen</h2>
    <div class="competencies-grid">
      <div class="competency-column">
        <div class="column-header">
          <span class="tech-tag">Industrial & Electrical</span>
          <h3>Klassisches Hard-Engineering</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="desc">
          Fundiertes mechanisches Verständnis gepaart mit industrieller Elektrotechnik und sicherheitskritischer Dokumentation.
        </p>
        <ul class="spec-list">
          <li><strong>Ausbildung:</strong> Industriemechaniker (Endmontage von Großmaschinen, mechanische Toleranzen & Fehleranalyse).</li>
          <li><strong>Zertifizierung:</strong> Staatlich geprüfter Elektrotechniker.</li>
          <li><strong>Fokus:</strong> Energie- & Kraftwerksanlagen, KKS-Kennzeichnungssysteme, Signalverfolgung.</li>
          <li><strong>Engineering Base & ECAD:</strong> Normgerechte Stromlaufpläne, Schaltungsunterlagen und Revisionsprüfung.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="competency-column">
        <div class="column-header">
          <span class="tech-tag">Systems & AI</span>
          <h3>Digitale Infrastruktur & Workflows</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="desc">
          Deterministische Systemadministration, Netzwerkarchitektur und praxisnahe Software-/KI-Pipelines.
        </p>
        <ul class="spec-list">
          <li><strong>Netzwerk & Security:</strong> Multi-VLAN-Segmentierung, DNS-Sinkholes (Pi-hole/AdGuard), Zero-Trust-Gateways.</li>
          <li><strong>Linux & Self-Hosting:</strong> Debian-Stacks, Docker-Container, Home Assistant (Matter/Thread-Infrastruktur).</li>
          <li><strong>Code & Automatisierung:</strong> C#, Shell-Scripting, Astro/Vite und automatisierte CI/CD-Deployments.</li>
          <li><strong>Agentic AI Workflows:</strong> Lokale LLM-Toolchains (Ollama, Aider CLI, Hermes) für iterative Entwicklung.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .competencies-section {
    padding: 3rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }
  .competencies-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .competencies-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: #f8fafc;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .competencies-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  .competency-column {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }
  .column-header {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .tech-tag {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: #38bdf8;
    font-family: monospace;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  .competency-column h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #f1f5f9;
  }
  .desc {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .spec-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .spec-list li {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    position: relative;
  }
  .spec-list li::before {
    content: "▹";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: #38bdf8;
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .competencies-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
